# src/packages/control-ui/src/utils

## Purpose
Source folder `src/packages/control-ui/src/utils`. It groups the files and child modules listed below; behavior ownership stays with the nearest named module.

## Contents
- Direct files (6): `crypt1.go`, `crypt1.ts`, `crypt1_test.go`, `routingPresets.ts`, `stampFeed.ts`, `v2raynImport.ts`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `crypt1`.
